WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:04.140
Now that The Last of Us is an HBO&nbsp;
series, fans have a lot of questions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.140 --> 00:00:08.340
like how similar will it be to the&nbsp;
plot of the game, and more importantly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:12.780
when will it be released? Well, we've got&nbsp;
answers. Here's everything you need to know.

00:00:12.780 --> 00:00:16.260
First thing people want to know&nbsp;
is: Is there a trailer? Yep,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:21.120
and a short teaser. The teaser for The&nbsp;
Last of Us dropped on September 26,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:26.460
and it was a doozy. Set to "Alone and Forsaken"&nbsp;
by Hank Williams, we see Joel as a hardened man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:32.280
living in a world we can't imagine. Ellie appears&nbsp;
scared yet strong, and we see the duo getting&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:36.900
paired up as they journey across the country,&nbsp;
in addition to a shot of the dreaded clicker.

00:00:37.375 --> 00:00:38.635
"Save who you can save."

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.760
The official trailer dropped December 3,&nbsp;
2022, set to a haunting remix of A-ha's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:49.800
"Take on Me." This one digs deeper into Joel&nbsp;
and Ellie's complicated relationship and ends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.780
with a terrifying shot of the bloater. In short,&nbsp;
both previews prove The Last of Us will get dark&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:59.820
quickly and stay very loyal to the game, which&nbsp;
has accrued a fandom of dedicated players.
 &nbsp;

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:04.500
As for a release date, HBO Max confirmed on&nbsp;
Instagram that The Last of Us is dropping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:10.860
on January 15, 2023. The streamer's hands were&nbsp;
somewhat tied, after they accidentally leaked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:17.220
the date on November 1, 2022. HBO Max features&nbsp;
a one-minute sneak peek of the series, which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:22.260
mentioned the release date in its description,&nbsp;
but shortly after the news spread, the date was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.260 --> 00:01:28.500
deleted. Less than 24 hours later, the streaming&nbsp;
giant officially released the January 15th date&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.560
to the world. The series will have nine episodes&nbsp;
and air on HBO at 9 p.m. Eastern Standard Time.  
 &nbsp;

00:01:34.560 --> 00:01:39.900
Now here's the big question everyone wants&nbsp;
answered: What is the plot of the show? Well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.900 --> 00:01:44.040
seeing as The Last of Us is based on the&nbsp;
immensely popular video games of the same name,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.720
the plot is pretty well-known at this point.&nbsp;
With four current games in its franchise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:53.580
The Last of Us is full of stories that can&nbsp;
substantiate multiple seasons of the HBO&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:59.280
series. According to Variety, the drama will&nbsp;
cover the events of the 2013 introductory game&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.280 --> 00:02:06.060
and possibly some of the most recent — 2022's&nbsp;
The Last of Us Part II. HBO released a brief&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:11.040
synopsis of the series, which aligns with what&nbsp;
we know about the games. The synopsis reads:

00:02:26.534 --> 00:02:30.720
HBO also clarified these events&nbsp;
would take place 20 years after the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.720 --> 00:02:33.960
destruction of modern civilization.
 
As for the stars of the series,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:39.420
The Last of Us is led by Pedro Pascal, who&nbsp;
plays the tough and brooding Joel. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:43.560
Bella Ramsey stars as young Ellie.&nbsp;
The pair are "found family" and will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.560 --> 00:02:48.301
see and experience things fans of the game&nbsp;
likely dread watching play out on screen.

00:02:48.301 --> 00:02:49.680
"I'm not family?"

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:52.470
"No. You're cargo."

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:55.500
Gabriel Luna also stars in the drama as Tommy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:01.200
Joel's former soldier-brother. Merle Dandridge&nbsp;
will also appear as Fireflies leader Marlene.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:06.120
Also on the cast is Anna Torv, playing&nbsp;
Tess, another survivor of the pandemic.

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:11.760
HBO also notes the series will have a handful&nbsp;
of guest stars, including Nick Offerman and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:16.800
Murray Bartlett, who are survivors far removed&nbsp;
from the terror living in a remote town. Nico&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:21.300
Parker will play Joel's teenage daughter&nbsp;
Sarah while Storm Reid appears as Riley,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:26.520
Ellie's Bostonian best friend. According to&nbsp;
Collider, the HBO series will also feature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.520 --> 00:03:31.380
actors from the Last of Us game itself —&nbsp;
most notably Troy Baker and Ashley Johnson,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.380 --> 00:03:35.940
who originated the roles now played&nbsp;
by Pedro Pascal and Bella Ramsey.

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.740
Finally, fans of The Last of Us video game&nbsp;
franchise should have one final reason to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:46.920
excited because Emmy-winner Craig Mazin serves as&nbsp;
the showrunner for the new series. Mazin was also&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:51.960
the showrunner of the widely praised Chernobyl&nbsp;
limited series, proving he has what it takes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:57.420
handle a high-stakes HBO project. Mazin also&nbsp;
wrote the story alongside Neil Druckmann,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.420 --> 00:04:02.640
the creative director of The Last of Us video&nbsp;
games. Druckmann will also executive produce.

